XVG 1.0 "Tesseract" Sample File
================================

This file demonstrates the XVG format structure:

Header:
- Width: 800
- Height: 600
- Frame Count: 1
- Frame Rate: 30

Vector Commands:
- Sample path data would be here
- Transform matrices would be here

Assets:
- Sample PNG/JPEG data would be here

Metadata:
- JSON metadata would be here

CRC-32 Footer:
- Checksum would be here

Note: This is a text representation for demonstration.
Real XVG files are binary with the structure defined in xvg-spec/spec.md 